From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ayman <ayman@pipa>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sm8250-xiaomi-pipa: fix duplicate cpu7 OPP label

The pipa overlay adds opp-3187200000 under &cpu7_opp_table with label
cpu7_opp21, but sm8250.dtsi already defines cpu7_opp21 on opp-3091200000.
Rename the higher-frequency node to cpu7_opp22 so dtc no longer reports
duplicate_label and DTB build succeeds.
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
index 111111111111..222222222222 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sm8250-xiaomi-pipa.dts
@@ -309,7 +309,7 @@
 };
 
 &cpu7_opp_table {
-	cpu7_opp21: opp-3187200000 {
+	cpu7_opp22: opp-3187200000 {
 		opp-hz = /bits/ 64 <3187200000>;
 		opp-peak-kBps = <8368000 51609600>;
 	};
--
2.47.1
